<title>INDIA: India's VSNL 1995/96 net rises.</title>
<headline>India's VSNL 1995/96 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in billion rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     4.09 vs   2.99</p>
<p>    Gross Income	  44.73 vs  36.07</p>
<p>    Other income	   0.39 vs   0.47</p>
<p>    Expenditure	   37.01 vs  30.72</p>
<p>    Interest		 0.07 vs   0.43</p>
<p>    Gross profit	  77.16 vs  53.47</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   0.56 vs   0.50</p>
<p>    Tax			2.85 vs   2.22</p>
<p>Note: Videsh Sanchar Nigam Ltd (VSNL) is India's state-backed external telecommunications firm.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom (91-11-301 2024)</p>
</text>
